{"id": "EUVD-2026-76551", "enisaUuid": "2f67684d-6be2-31a4-bc25-dee0509a0fff", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ncifs: use cifs_invalidate_cache() in cifs_do_truncate() for O_TRUNC\n\ncifs_do_truncate() is invoked from cifs_open() without i_rwsem, so it\ncannot use cifs_resize_file_locked() to perform a proper fscache cookie\nresize.  Instead, add cifs_invalidate_cache() after cifs_setsize().\n\ncifs_invalidate_cache() calls fscache_invalidate(), which works without\nholding i_rwsem: it unconditionally increments inval_counter and sets\nFSCACHE_COOKIE_NO_DATA_TO_READ, ensuring that stale cached data is not\nserved once the cookie is later activated by fscache_use_cookie().\nTruncation to zero leaves no valid cached data, making invalidation the\ncorrect semantic here.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:45:32", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:50:11", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8b9b10fe5b8b492b27b9f4546742ea541a650213", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/81fc3868a7f726980ff845c1d0d271051e5f0f45", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/364b183230586a62660a7280c1eb20138338eeb5"], "aliases": ["GHSA-m6p4-6vjr-qq2h", "CVE-2026-89639"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0f10af62-9d27-3928-ada0-28ac6b8eb9ad", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "efbcecdecefc26fa062c0e8210533ccad7d6bd4a <8b9b10fe5b8b492b27b9f4546742ea541a650213"}, {"id": "28f325de-b063-3913-8d80-a877b9bb4a14", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.12.105 <6.13"}, {"id": "2aa30c76-6a3a-3e41-9252-e9f51a550b8a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fa724e235cfdb0fb0bb427d0f9dfe864ae27403e <364b183230586a62660a7280c1eb20138338eeb5"}, {"id": "3a791111-58a3-34fe-a124-5a5ae1fd5e5f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.4"}, {"id": "40d467c3-2931-3f2a-8d43-8378c80ba47f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.18.44 <6.18.50"}, {"id": "58e4ca64-cdd8-3ee1-ac3e-445ebfe46761", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.2"}, {"id": "5f4c76b9-0c75-39e4-9115-c137583c46b5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3513f3931c579ba2a715784c6dedc59e0d9282ee"}, {"id": "6f131af6-a323-33af-8fad-a916269220e8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "a5a70528-4e73-3db2-b34a-db9a2ebc18ad", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "b3db1351-eed3-3479-ad81-5d24a49ef0e3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "75640976cf474eb41682a13f2dbe9534ac26ca50"}, {"id": "d0b12c72-9cfc-3203-a08b-1199c1eff9d6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6838bcac954487cc0a3c8a4ee1b3a3a30e244dc9"}, {"id": "d26e639f-cc35-3d1a-b7b3-edc596c11e93", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.50"}, {"id": "f5cf47e3-b82c-3829-98e9-e3aba42f9055", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.1.8 <7.2"}, {"id": "ff99c00b-13e3-3c1b-b712-1de3eaaf5382", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fa724e235cfdb0fb0bb427d0f9dfe864ae27403e <81fc3868a7f726980ff845c1d0d271051e5f0f45"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "774ee7de-fc67-393e-b226-75741aa60220", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}